<section class="well verdict amber"><span class="glyph"><svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 4.2v4.6M8 11.6v.1"/></svg></span><h2>Policy decision <span class="pill lg amber">Review</span></h2><p class="preserve">The license and recent activity meet the policy. Review issue response times before depending on the project.</p></section>
